{"id": "fraud-01", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You write fraud-alert narratives for the risk analytics team at Cypress Harbor Credit Union\n(fictional). The card fraud system flagged the alert below overnight. Read the alert and the 90-day card history and\nanswer the question. Patterns: card testing (small authorizations, often $1.00 or less, at one online merchant,\nfollowed by a large purchase), account takeover (new device, changed contact details, then transfers), lost or stolen\ncard (card-present use far from the member's usual area), and first-party misuse (the member's own spending\ndisputed).\n\n# Alert\n\nAlert FA-2026-10-0418, debit card ending 2209, score 912/999.\n2026-10-06 02:11  ONLINE  QUICKPAY*DONATE    US  1.00  approved\n2026-10-06 02:12  ONLINE  QUICKPAY*DONATE    US  1.00  approved\n2026-10-06 02:12  ONLINE  QUICKPAY*DONATE    US  1.00  approved\n2026-10-06 02:19  ONLINE  ELECTRO HUB OUTLET US  849.99  declined by rule CNP-HIGH\n\n# Card history since June 1, debit card ending 2209 (oldest first)\n\n2026-06-02  ONLINE       CHEWY.COM              FL     62.18  approved\n2026-06-02  ONLINE       HOME DEPOT 6311        FL      9.70  approved\n2026-06-02  CARD PRESENT HOME DEPOT 6311        FL     30.70  approved\n2026-06-03  CARD PRESENT CHEWY.COM              FL    139.17  approved\n2026-06-04  CARD PRESENT DUNKIN #34018          FL     28.18  approved\n2026-06-04  ONLINE       WALGREENS #12203       FL    155.26  approved\n2026-06-06  ONLINE       DUNKIN #34018          FL     54.41  approved\n2026-06-08  ONLINE       CHIPOTLE 2104          FL     64.73  approved\n2026-06-10  CARD PRESENT PLANTATION CAR WASH    FL    143.27  approved\n2026-06-11  CARD PRESENT PUBLIX #1132           FL     39.05  approved\n2026-06-11  ONLINE       WALGREENS #12203       FL     32.68  approved\n2026-06-13  CARD PRESENT SHELL OIL 57441        FL     80.15  approved\n2026-06-14  CARD PRESENT WINN-DIXIE #0244       FL    141.32  approved\n2026-06-15